Note on third-party code:
The file corpus_scripts/load_model.py and the training scripts nwp_gru.py /
nwp_tf.py are derived from the next_word_prediction repository by Danny Merkx
and Mirjam Frank (https://github.com/DannyMerkx/next_word_prediction).
Their original licence applies to those files.

Note on data:
The experimental stimuli and behavioural data in the data/ folder are released
for reproducibility purposes. If you use them, please cite the associated paper.
